---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Disclosures" description="Important disclosures regarding our affiliate relationships, advertising practices, and compliance.">
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-4xl px-4 py-16">
    <article class="glass-card p-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">Disclosures</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mb-6">Last Updated: March 1, 2025</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-4 mb-2">Advertising Disclosure</h2>
      <p>SecureLoan is an <strong>advertising-supported, free-to-consumer matching service</strong>. We receive compensation from lenders and financial service providers when consumers are referred to them via our platform. This compensation may influence which products or lenders are featured on our site and their order of presentation. It does not affect the terms of any offer you receive or your eligibility with any lender.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Not a Lender or Broker</h2>
      <p>SecureLoan is not a lender, mortgage broker, insurance agent, or financial advisor. We do not originate loans, issue credit, or make lending decisions. All offers come from independent third-party lenders who are solely responsible for their products and services.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">No Guarantee of Approval</h2>
      <p>Submission of a loan request does not guarantee you will receive a loan offer, a specific loan amount, rate, or term. Approval is at the sole discretion of the participating lender based on their underwriting criteria.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">APR & Cost Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Annual Percentage Rates (APR) offered by lenders in our network range from <strong>5.99% to 35.99%</strong>. Loan amounts range from <strong>$100 to $50,000</strong>. Repayment terms range from <strong>61 days to 72 months</strong>. Short-term loans may carry a higher effective APR. The APR, fees, and terms of any specific loan will be disclosed by the lender before you accept an offer.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">FCRA Disclosure</h2>
      <p>By submitting a request, you authorize SecureLoan and participating lenders to obtain consumer report information about you. Some lenders may perform a soft credit inquiry that does not affect your credit score. A hard credit inquiry, which may impact your score, will only occur if you proceed with a formal loan application with a specific lender.</p>
      <p>You have the right to a free credit report annually at <strong>annualcreditreport.com</strong> or by calling <strong>1-877-322-8228</strong>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">State Availability</h2>
      <p>This service and the loan products available through it are not available in all states. Nothing on this website constitutes an offer or solicitation to provide credit in any state where such activity is prohibited or where we or our lender partners are not licensed.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Equal Credit Opportunity</h2>
      <p>Lenders in our network are required to comply with the Equal Credit Opportunity Act (ECOA). Credit is extended without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, marital status, age, or because you receive public assistance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-6 mb-2">Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>SecureLoan</strong><br/>
      123 Financial District Ave, Suite 400, New York, NY 10005<br/>
      Email: compliance@secureloan.example.com</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
